 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_4olcy-CAYoQ7kNvwGdIHJc&_nc_oc=AdobUTrqjrY6m4TsANC9KLEUQk-KbEJY1-pS7FWbSbFlYAvYlcASC0keyAnH_IRWmLo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQo7ghUbytPrxVbMxdnZ4FJ9lozrhQ0n9dyG2ME8kI7cw&oe=6AF335C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qsy6e28wc30Q7kNvwEEj7Rc&_nc_oc=Adrgli2YNeKE2edqBdJVF57Pxk36OdkDR_6QG55OXXMmMTDBiGn53Lp0wPl4kjL6FIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTggUnvz-nl-dHxwwWSjsSXDg5SUJNxumJkPmevYA6GpQ&oe=6AF34326"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O9V95Y5qD-UQ7kNvwEvGi0Q&_nc_oc=Adrpszk1iCQuHLxFUhtv0D5d8TkVx24ytPRYN0DuSaxqKwzEWkBom-6fkzS1yjyoogQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAHkHiGVEJMzxr3FXPpfZTDBwmxyQJGREj8tbEXDDXdg&oe=6AF34D1C"}, {"fil